---
// Triangle relationship connecting P/E, P/B, and ROE via Market Cap, Net Profit, and Book Equity.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 285;
---
<figure class="sbp7-tri">
  <div class="sbp7-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Valuation triangle showing Market Cap ÷ Net Profit = P/E, Market Cap ÷ Book Equity = P/B, Net Profit ÷ Book Equity = ROE, and the identity P/B = P/E × ROE.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp7-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>P/E, P/B, and ROE are one triangle: P/B always equals P/E × ROE</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>P/E, P/B và ROE thực chất là một tam giác khép kín: P/B luôn bằng P/E × ROE</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* P/E */}
      <rect x="20" y="56" width="265" height="156" rx="10" class="sbp7-card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="hourglass" x={48} y={84} size={22} />
      <text x="72" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr">P/E = Price ÷ EPS</text>
      <text x="36" y="122" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Years of earnings to pay price</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Trả trước bao nhiêu năm lãi</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="36" y="150" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Inverse E/P = Earnings Yield</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Nghịch đảo E/P = Tỷ suất lãi</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="36" y="182" class="sbp7-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>e.g. P/E 10x ≈ 10% E/P yield</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>VD: P/E 10x ≈ sinh lời E/P 10%</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* P/B */}
      <rect x="317" y="56" width="265" height="156" rx="10" class="sbp7-card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="bank" x={345} y={84} size={22} />
      <text x="369" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr">P/B = Price ÷ BVPS</text>
      <text x="333" y="122" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Price vs net accounting equity</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Thị giá so với Vốn chủ sở hữu</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="333" y="150" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Steady anchor when profit dips</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Mỏ neo ổn định khi lãi biến động</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="333" y="182" class="sbp7-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Key lens for Banks &amp; Brokers</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thước đo chính cho Ngân hàng</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* ROE */}
      <rect x="615" y="56" width="265" height="156" rx="10" class="sbp7-card-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={643} y={84} size={22} />
      <text x="667" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr sbp7-red">ROE = Profit ÷ Equity</text>
      <text x="631" y="122" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Profit per 100 đ of owner equity</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Lãi tạo ra trên 100 đ vốn chủ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="631" y="150" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Explains WHY P/B differs</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Lý giải VÌ SAO P/B cao hay thấp</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="631" y="182" class="sbp7-sub sbp7-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>20% ROE at P/E 10x → fair P/B 2.0x</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>ROE 20% với P/E 10x → P/B = 2,0x</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Identity */}
      <rect x="20" y="228" width="860" height="42" rx="8" class="sbp7-card" />
      <text x="450" y="254" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp7-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Identity: P/B = P/E × ROE  (if a bank makes only 8% ROE, P/B = 0.8x is already P/E = 10x — never blind-buy low P/B!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đẳng thức: P/B = P/E × ROE  (ngân hàng chỉ đạt ROE 8% thì P/B = 0,8x đã tương đương P/E 10x — đừng thấy P/B &lt; 1 là vội nghĩ rẻ!)</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>P/E, P/B, and ROE are algebraically locked: you only need any two to compute the third. Paying 2.0x book value for a 20%-ROE bank buys earnings at the exact same P/E = 10x as paying 0.8x book for an 8%-ROE bank.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>P/E, P/B và ROE khóa chặt vào nhau bằng đẳng thức toán học: chỉ cần biết hai số là suy ra số thứ ba. Mua một ngân hàng ROE 20% ở P/B 2,0 lần thực chất có P/E = 10 lần — ngang với ngân hàng ROE 8% ở P/B 0,8 lần.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp7-tri { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp7-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp7-tri svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp7-tri text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp7-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp7-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .sbp7-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp7-hdr { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp7-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp7-body { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp7-sub { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp7-tri figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
